  "authoring": {
    "note": "A long shed beside the barrier where bags are opened on trestle tables. Two inspectors on a normal day and six when something has happened. Anything that cannot be explained in one sentence goes into a numbered tray and comes back at the end of the working week, or does not. Regulars pack accordingly: one bag, nothing wrapped, nothing sealed.",
